<title>POLAND: Subscriptions for Centrostal IPO reduced by 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Subscriptions for Centrostal IPO reduced by 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor subscriptions for shares in the Polish Centrostal SA steel-products maker were reduced by 22.14 percent, Centrostal said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue price was 4.2 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>The company, which is offering one million new shares, wants to enter the Warsaw bourse in February or March.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
